## Deploy in one click

`npm run build` emits a plain static `dist/` — no server, no special runtime — so it deploys anywhere that serves files. This very site is a Darkmown build:

<a class="btn primary" href="https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FZVN-DEV%2Fdarkmown">Deploy to Vercel</a>
<a class="btn" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FZVN-DEV%2Fdarkmown">Deploy to Cloudflare</a>
